@startuml
title FE-09 — Recalculate, Rank and Persist Candidates
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
hide footbox
autonumber

actor Recruiter
boundary "React Ranking Page" as FE
control "Tenant + JWT Security" as Security
boundary RankingController as Controller
control RankingService as Service
entity "Tenant Ranking Data" as Data
control RankingCalculator as Calculator
control RecommendationPolicy as Policy
database "Dedicated Tenant DB" as DB

note over Security,DB
Preconditions: authenticated RECRUITER; JWT tenant matches X-Tenant-ID;
Recruiter owns the Job. AI results are advisory only.
end note

Recruiter -> FE: Request ranking refresh for selected Job
FE -> Security: POST /jobs/{jobId}/rankings/recompute
activate Security
Security -> Security: Resolve tenant, authenticate and set TenantContext
alt Invalid tenant, role or Job ownership
  Security --> FE: 403/404 ApiResponse
  Security -> Security: Clear TenantContext
  deactivate Security
else Authorized
  Security -> Controller: Forward tenant-scoped request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: recomputeAndPersist(jobId, MANUAL)
  activate Service
  Service -> Data: lock Job and load config + applications + current sources
  activate Data
  Data -> DB: SELECT tenant-owned ranking inputs
  DB --> Data: Job, config, CV, assessment, interview evidence
  Data --> Service: RankingInput
  deactivate Data
  alt Configuration invalid or stale
    Service --> Controller: 400 validation / 409 revision conflict
    Controller --> FE: Error ApiResponse
  else Valid configuration
    loop Every application in the Job
      Service -> Calculator: calculate(config, official sources)
      activate Calculator
      Calculator -> Calculator: Validate scores and compute weighted/partial score
      Calculator --> Service: ScoreBreakdown + completeness + cohort
      deactivate Calculator
      Service -> Policy: classify and explain(score, completeness, evidence)
      Policy --> Service: STRONG_FIT / REVIEW / NOT_RECOMMENDED + reasons
    end
    Service -> Calculator: rank comparable rows by cohort and score
    Calculator --> Service: Competition ranks; applicationId stable order
    Service -> DB: BEGIN; replace Job snapshots with new version
    alt Persistence succeeds
      DB --> Service: COMMIT
      Service --> Controller: RankingBoardResponse
      Controller --> FE: 200 board + breakdown + version
      FE --> Recruiter: Display explainable ranking
    else Persistence fails
      DB --> Service: ROLLBACK
      Service --> Controller: Domain persistence error
      Controller --> FE: 5xx generic error; previous snapshot remains
    end
  end
  deactivate Service
  deactivate Controller
  Security -> Security: Clear TenantContext in finally
  deactivate Security
end

note over Service,Policy
The recommendation label never changes Application.status.
Reject/shortlist decisions require the separate human-review flow.
end note
@enduml
